doc:sec-6da-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "6DA(1) Nominated ART members" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Attorney-General may, by writing, nominate a person who holds one of the following appointments to the Administrative Review Tribunal to issue warrants (except to the National Anti-Corruption Commission) under Part 2-5:  (a) Deputy President;  (b) senior member;  (c) general member." ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6da-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6DA(2) Nominated ART members"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6da-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) Despite subsection (1), the Attorney-General must not nominate a person who holds an appointment as a senior member on a  Introduction  Chapter 1 Interpretation  Part 1-2  Section 6DB  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  sessional basis or a general member of the Tribunal unless the person:  (a) is enrolled as a legal practitioner of the High Court, of another federal court or of the Supreme Court of a State or of the Australian Capital Territory; and  (b) has been so enrolled for not less than 5 years." ;
    skos:definition "(2) Despite subsection (1), the Attorney-General must not nominate a person who holds an appointment as a senior member on a  Introduction  Chapter 1 Interpretation  Part 1-2  Section 6DB  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  sessional basis or a general member of the Tribunal unless the person:  (a) is enrolled as a legal practitioner of the High Court, of another federal court or of the Supreme Court of a State or of the Australian Capital Territory; and  (b) has been so enrolled for not less than 5 years."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "57a14384047b5fd2db8d1d2b794a837fe56c217b0cba0eaebf40912fb429d0d7" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6da ;
    cof:pageNumber "96"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Cannot nominate a person without being enrolled as a legal practitioner for at least 5 years." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
