concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6f a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6F Offences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6f ;
    values:originalText "Except so far as the contrary intention appears, a reference in this Act to an offence, or to an offence of a particular kind, is a reference to an offence, or to an offence of that kind, as the case may be, that:  (a) has been committed or is being committed; or  (b) is suspected on reasonable grounds of having been committed, of being committed or of being likely to be committed.  Chapter 1  Introduction" ;
    skos:definition "Except so far as the contrary intention appears, a reference in this Act to an offence, or to an offence of a particular kind, is a reference to an offence, or to an offence of that kind, as the case may be, that:  (a) has been committed or is being committed; or  (b) is suspected on reasonable grounds of having been committed, of being committed or of being likely to be committed.  Chapter 1  Introduction"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "90b819c82c2ff80c5119f8b73bc42a0b1ac9cc26ea9d8e6aad902fafb1ac0132" ;
    cof:pageNumber "101"^^xsd:integer ;
