doc:sec-10-ss-1a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10(1A) Issue of warrant by Director-General of Security in emergency" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1A) The reference in subparagraph (1)(d)(ii) to the interception not commencing includes a reference to the communications, that were  Interception of telecommunications  Chapter 2 Warrants authorising the Organisation to intercept telecommunications  Part 2-2  Section 11A  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  to be intercepted, not being accessed as stored communications after they have ceased to pass over a telecommunications system." ;
