    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) To avoid doubt, and without limiting subsection (1), if approval is given to a person or class of persons holding, occupying or performing the duties of an office or position, then the approval extends to such an office or position that comes into existence after the approval is given." ;
    cof:pageNumber "135"^^xsd:integer .

