doc:sec-12-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12(4) Persons authorised to intercept communications for Organisation" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Director-General of Security must, as soon as practicable after the authority conferred by a Part 2-2 warrant is exercised on behalf of the Organisation, cause one or more written records to be made that identify each person who exercised that authority." ;
