doc:sec-18-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "18(3) Evidentiary certificates" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Director-General of Security or the Deputy Director-General of Security may issue a written certificate signed by him or her setting out such facts as he or she considers relevant with respect to acts or things done:  (a) in order to enable, or in connection with enabling, a warrant issued under this Part to be executed; or  (b) in connection with the execution of a warrant issued under this Part." ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-18-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18(4) Evidentiary certificates"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-18-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The Director-General of Security or the Deputy Director-General of Security may issue a written certificate signed by him or her setting out such facts as he or she considers relevant with respect to anything done by an ASIO employee or an ASIO affiliate:  (a) in connection with the execution of a warrant issued under this Part; or  (b) in connection with:  (i) the communication by a person to another person of; or  (ii) the making use of; or  (iii) the making of a record of; or  (iv) the custody of a record of; or  (v) the giving in evidence of;  information obtained by the execution of such a warrant." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The Director-General of Security or the Deputy Director-General of Security may issue a written certificate signed by him or her setting out such facts as he or she considers relevant with respect to anything done by an ASIO employee or an ASIO affiliate:  (a) in connection with the execution of a warrant issued under this Part; or  (b) in connection with:  (i) the communication by a person to another person of; or  (ii) the making use of; or  (iii) the making of a record of; or  (iv) the custody of a record of; or  (v) the giving in evidence of;  information obtained by the execution of such a warrant."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "aa98ce7f423aba8f6403e1a2756247b938460291573fe778b622ac2e27977161" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-18 ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Issue written certificate with relevant facts about ASIO employee or affiliate activities" ;
