concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-31-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "31(2) Applications for authorisation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-31-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The request:  (a) must be in writing; and  (b) must include details of the development or testing of technologies, or interception capabilities, in relation to which authorisation is sought; and  (c) must include details of the extent to which the development or testing would involve, or would be likely to involve, interception of communications passing over a telecommunications system; and  (d) must refer to the functions of the authority that the development or testing would support; and  (e) must state the grounds for seeking the authorisation; and  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The request:  (a) must be in writing; and  (b) must include details of the development or testing of technologies, or interception capabilities, in relation to which authorisation is sought; and  (c) must include details of the extent to which the development or testing would involve, or would be likely to involve, interception of communications passing over a telecommunications system; and  (d) must refer to the functions of the authority that the development or testing would support; and  (e) must state the grounds for seeking the authorisation; and  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications"@en ;
