    values:originalText "(4A) If paragraph (1)(a) applies to the authorisation, this Part does not require that an authorised interception must involve:  (a) one or more employees of the security authority referred to in that paragraph; and  (b) one or more employees of a carrier referred to in that paragraph; acting together or in the presence of each other." ;
