doc:sec-31ab a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "31AB Access to stored communications under section 31A" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "authorisations  In addition to authorising interception of communications, a section 31A authorisation also authorises a person to access a stored communication if the section 31A authorisation would have authorised interception of the communication if it were still passing over a telecommunications system." ;
