concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-42-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "42(4) Affidavit to accompany written application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-42-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the application is for a telecommunications service warrant, the affidavit shall set out, in relation to the service, and in relation to each person to whom the application relates, the following information, so far as it can be derived from the agency’s records:  (a) the number of previous applications (if any) for warrants that the agency has made and that related to the service or to that person, as the case may be;  (b) the number of warrants (if any) previously issued on such applications; and  (c) particulars of the use made by the agency of information obtained by interceptions under such warrants." ;
    skos:definition "(4) If the application is for a telecommunications service warrant, the affidavit shall set out, in relation to the service, and in relation to each person to whom the application relates, the following information, so far as it can be derived from the agency’s records:  (a) the number of previous applications (if any) for warrants that the agency has made and that related to the service or to that person, as the case may be;  (b) the number of warrants (if any) previously issued on such applications; and  (c) particulars of the use made by the agency of information obtained by interceptions under such warrants."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7db4e6d3450042fdd914f0e3d676c20dfe14028477c234a94d15668ce0bc6505" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-42 ;
    cof:pageNumber "162"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must provide information about previous applications and warrants." ;
    dc:description "true" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
