    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-49-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) A warrant issued under subsection 46(1) or 46A(1), or issued under section 48 in the circumstances mentioned in subsection 46(1),  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications" ;
