concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-59a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "59A Notification to Secretary of the Department"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-59a ;
    values:originalText "(1) Where a Part 2-5 warrant is issued to an agency, the chief officer of the agency must cause a copy of the warrant to be given to the Secretary of the Department as soon as practicable.  (2) Where:  (a) it is proposed, under a warrant issued under section 46A, to intercept communications made to or from a telecommunications service; and  (b) the warrant is not a warrant that authorises interception of communications made by means of a telecommunications device or telecommunications devices identified in the warrant; and  (c) the service was not identified in the warrant; the chief officer must cause the Secretary of the Department to be given, as soon as practicable, a description in writing of the service sufficient to identify it." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Where a Part 2-5 warrant is issued to an agency, the chief officer of the agency must cause a copy of the warrant to be given to the Secretary of the Department as soon as practicable.  (2) Where:  (a) it is proposed, under a warrant issued under section 46A, to intercept communications made to or from a telecommunications service; and  (b) the warrant is not a warrant that authorises interception of communications made by means of a telecommunications device or telecommunications devices identified in the warrant; and  (c) the service was not identified in the warrant; the chief officer must cause the Secretary of the Department to be given, as soon as practicable, a description in writing of the service sufficient to identify it."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ff98c512d039cafa362b7b1948a3e0d8672782cf9c996e83911fc246eb03b9e2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "202"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-59a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-59a-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
