doc:sec-59a-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "59A(2) Notification to Secretary of the Department" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Where:  (a) it is proposed, under a warrant issued under section 46A, to intercept communications made to or from a telecommunications service; and  (b) the warrant is not a warrant that authorises interception of communications made by means of a telecommunications device or telecommunications devices identified in the warrant; and  (c) the service was not identified in the warrant; the chief officer must cause the Secretary of the Department to be given, as soon as practicable, a description in writing of the service sufficient to identify it." ;
