doc:sec-60-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "60(4) Notification to authorised representative of carrier of issue or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) Where:  (a) an authorised representative of a carrier has been informed, under subsection (1), of the issue of a named person warrant; and  (aa) the warrant is not a warrant that authorises interception of communications made by means of a telecommunications device or telecommunications devices identified in the warrant; and  (b) it is proposed, under the warrant, to intercept communications made to or from a telecommunications service operated by a carrier; and  (c) the service was not identified in the warrant; a certifying officer of the agency must cause that authorised representative to be given, as soon as practicable, a description in writing of the service sufficient to identify it." ;
    cof:pageNumber "204"^^xsd:integer .

