doc:sec-62 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "62 Application of Part" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Except so far as the contrary intention appears, this Part applies in relation to:  (a) information, whether obtained before or after the commencement of this Part;  (b) an interception, whether before or after that commencement, of a communication; and  (c) a proceeding, whether begun before or after that commencement." ;
