doc:sec-63b-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "63B(2) Dealing in information by employees of carriers" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) An employee of a carrier may communicate or cause to be communicated to another carrier, or to an employee of another carrier, information (being information that has been lawfully obtained or obtained by intercepting a communication in contravention of subsection 7(1)) relating to:  (a) the operation or maintenance of a telecommunications network operated by the other carrier; or  (b) the supply of services by the other carrier by means of a telecommunications network; if the communication of the information is for the purpose of the carrying on by the other carrier of its business relating to the supply of services by means of a telecommunications network operated by the other carrier." ;
    cof:pageNumber "223"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-63b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "63B(3) Dealing in information by employees of carriers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-63b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An employee of a carrier may, in the performance of his or her duties as such an employee, communicate or make use of, or cause to be communicated, interception warrant information if the information is reasonably necessary to enable the interception of a communication under a warrant.  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications" ;
    skos:definition "(3) An employee of a carrier may, in the performance of his or her duties as such an employee, communicate or make use of, or cause to be communicated, interception warrant information if the information is reasonably necessary to enable the interception of a communication under a warrant.  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "629de83187bb240313aa9370ab9dbe1f8198a92d4b7fa680f07eb5e38bf3e52f" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-63b ;
    cof:pageNumber "223"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Employee may communicate interception warrant information in performance of duties." ;
