concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-68a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "68A Communicating information obtained by the Secretary of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-68a ;
    values:originalText "Attorney-General’s Department  (1) This section applies to information communicated to the Secretary of the Department administered by the Attorney-General as described in an item of the following table:  Information to which this section applies Item Information communicated under this provision: For the purpose of providing it to this entity: paragraph 68(l) the foreign country concerned paragraph 68(la) the International Criminal Court paragraph 68(lb) the War Crimes Tribunal concerned  (2) Each of the following:  (a) the Secretary of that Department;  (b) a person authorised by that Secretary;  (c) a person or other entity to whom the information has been communicated under this subsection; may communicate the information to another person or entity for purposes connected with providing the information to the entity mentioned in that table item." ;
    skos:definition "Attorney-General’s Department  (1) This section applies to information communicated to the Secretary of the Department administered by the Attorney-General as described in an item of the following table:  Information to which this section applies Item Information communicated under this provision: For the purpose of providing it to this entity: paragraph 68(l) the foreign country concerned paragraph 68(la) the International Criminal Court paragraph 68(lb) the War Crimes Tribunal concerned  (2) Each of the following:  (a) the Secretary of that Department;  (b) a person authorised by that Secretary;  (c) a person or other entity to whom the information has been communicated under this subsection; may communicate the information to another person or entity for purposes connected with providing the information to the entity mentioned in that table item."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c2edc5afabf4a79b3eede1e2cbe0de0f29cd6560c584bf903df30fa9f677f42f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "241"^^xsd:integer ;
