    values:originalText "(2) The person may communicate the relevant information to:  (a) the Attorney-General; or  (aa) the Minister; or  (b) the Director of Public Prosecutions; or  (c) the Commissioner of Police; or  (ca) the National Anti-Corruption Commissioner; or  (cb) the Inspector of the National Anti-Corruption Commission; or  (d) the Chief Executive Officer of the ACC." ;
    cof:pageNumber "242"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-71-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "71(3) Dealing with information where interception suspected to be"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-71-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person to whom the relevant information is communicated in accordance with subsection (2) may, for a purpose connected with:  (a) an investigation of a suspected offence;  (b) the making by an authority, body or person of a decision whether or not to begin a proceeding by way of a prosecution for a suspected offence; or  (c) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for a suspected offence; or for 2 or more such purposes, and for no other purpose, communicate to another person, make use of, or make a record of, some or all of the relevant information." ;
    skos:definition "(3) A person to whom the relevant information is communicated in accordance with subsection (2) may, for a purpose connected with:  (a) an investigation of a suspected offence;  (b) the making by an authority, body or person of a decision whether or not to begin a proceeding by way of a prosecution for a suspected offence; or  (c) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for a suspected offence; or for 2 or more such purposes, and for no other purpose, communicate to another person, make use of, or make a record of, some or all of the relevant information."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "27df7e7877a4fed428cfcff2d8bad1d4e230efc3cbe669b4bd46d37efdfe0a85" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-71 ;
    cof:pageNumber "242"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Communicating relevant information for specific purposes." ;
