doc:sec-100 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "100 Report to set out how many applications made and warrants" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "issued  (1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, and for each eligible authority of a State that was an agency at any time during that year:  (a) the relevant statistics about applications for Part 2-5 warrants that the agency or authority made during that year; and  (b) the relevant statistics about telephone applications for" ;
