concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-101 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "101 Report to contain particulars about duration of warrants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-101 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, and for each eligible authority of a State that was an agency at any time during that year:  (a) the average of the respective periods specified, in the Part 2-5 warrants that are original warrants and were issued on applications made by the agency or authority during that year, as the periods for which the warrants were to be in force; and  (b) the average of the respective periods during which the warrants referred to in paragraph (a) were in force; and  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, and for each eligible authority of a State that was an agency at any time during that year:  (a) the average of the respective periods specified, in the Part 2-5 warrants that are original warrants and were issued on applications made by the agency or authority during that year, as the periods for which the warrants were to be in force; and  (b) the average of the respective periods during which the warrants referred to in paragraph (a) were in force; and  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "da80dd3fd6499c382d17cee06fa8d8bf82d99b80979b2389334805da9d02489a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "279"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Report must contain particulars about duration of warrants" ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
