doc:sec-101 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "101 Report to contain particulars about duration of warrants" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, and for each eligible authority of a State that was an agency at any time during that year:  (a) the average of the respective periods specified, in the Part 2-5 warrants that are original warrants and were issued on applications made by the agency or authority during that year, as the periods for which the warrants were to be in force; and  (b) the average of the respective periods during which the warrants referred to in paragraph (a) were in force; and  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications" ;
    cof:pageNumber "279"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-102 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "102 Report to contain information about effectiveness of warrants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-102 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, for each eligible Commonwealth authority, and for each eligible authority of a State:  (a) how many arrests were made during that year:  (i) in connection with the performance by the agency or authority of its functions; and  (ii) on the basis of information that was or included lawfully intercepted information;  (b) the categories of the prescribed offences proceedings by way of prosecutions for which ended during that year, being proceedings in which, according to the records of the agency or authority, lawfully intercepted information was given in evidence; and  (c) in relation to each of those categories:  (i) the number of such offences in that category; and  (ii) the number of such offences in that category in respect of which convictions were recorded.  (2) The report shall set out:  (a) how many arrests were made during that year:  (i) in connection with the performance by Commonwealth agencies, by eligible Commonwealth authorities, and by  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, for each eligible Commonwealth authority, and for each eligible authority of a State:  (a) how many arrests were made during that year:  (i) in connection with the performance by the agency or authority of its functions; and  (ii) on the basis of information that was or included lawfully intercepted information;  (b) the categories of the prescribed offences proceedings by way of prosecutions for which ended during that year, being proceedings in which, according to the records of the agency or authority, lawfully intercepted information was given in evidence; and  (c) in relation to each of those categories:  (i) the number of such offences in that category; and  (ii) the number of such offences in that category in respect of which convictions were recorded.  (2) The report shall set out:  (a) how many arrests were made during that year:  (i) in connection with the performance by Commonwealth agencies, by eligible Commonwealth authorities, and by  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "85157a64f11feb9e3fb61181bc666e0d9ec44a30cf172e18a0525910d80e5d1b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "281"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-102-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-102-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.281" .
doc:sec-102 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "102 Report to contain information about effectiveness of warrants" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, for each eligible Commonwealth authority, and for each eligible authority of a State:  (a) how many arrests were made during that year:  (i) in connection with the performance by the agency or authority of its functions; and  (ii) on the basis of information that was or included lawfully intercepted information;  (b) the categories of the prescribed offences proceedings by way of prosecutions for which ended during that year, being proceedings in which, according to the records of the agency or authority, lawfully intercepted information was given in evidence; and  (c) in relation to each of those categories:  (i) the number of such offences in that category; and  (ii) the number of such offences in that category in respect of which convictions were recorded.  (2) The report shall set out:  (a) how many arrests were made during that year:  (i) in connection with the performance by Commonwealth agencies, by eligible Commonwealth authorities, and by  Chapter 2  Interception of telecommunications" ;
    cof:pageNumber "281"^^xsd:integer .

