doc:sec-106-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "106(2) Obstruction" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person obstructing or hindering has a reasonable excuse. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code)." ;
