concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-110b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "110B Declarations in relation to the Immigration and Border"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-110b ;
    values:originalText "Protection Department Provisions of Chapter 3 or 4 that do not apply to the Immigration and Border Protection Department  (1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:  (a) a specified provision in Chapter 3 or 4, referring to a criminal law-enforcement agency, does not apply in relation to the Immigration and Border Protection Department; or  (b) a specified provision in Chapter 4, referring to an enforcement agency, does not apply in relation to the Immigration and Border Protection Department. Provisions of Chapter 3 or 4 that have a limited application to the Immigration and Border Protection Department  (2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:  Chapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications" ;
    skos:definition "Protection Department Provisions of Chapter 3 or 4 that do not apply to the Immigration and Border Protection Department  (1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:  (a) a specified provision in Chapter 3 or 4, referring to a criminal law-enforcement agency, does not apply in relation to the Immigration and Border Protection Department; or  (b) a specified provision in Chapter 4, referring to an enforcement agency, does not apply in relation to the Immigration and Border Protection Department. Provisions of Chapter 3 or 4 that have a limited application to the Immigration and Border Protection Department  (2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:  Chapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2db1e50ab29babc06f9eb903e305816700d86a54d5ac03c0bc80d657e959e1c5" ;
    cof:pageNumber "319"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-110b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-110b-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.319" .
