    values:originalText "(1) The following:  (a) the Managing Director of a carrier or a body corporate of which the carrier is a subsidiary;  (b) the secretary of a carrier or a body corporate of which the carrier is a subsidiary;  (c) an employee of a carrier authorised in writing for the purposes of this paragraph by a person referred to in paragraph (a) or (b); may issue a written certificate signed by him or her setting out such facts as he or she considers relevant with respect to acts or things  Chapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The following:  (a) the Managing Director of a carrier or a body corporate of which the carrier is a subsidiary;  (b) the secretary of a carrier or a body corporate of which the carrier is a subsidiary;  (c) an employee of a carrier authorised in writing for the purposes of this paragraph by a person referred to in paragraph (a) or (b); may issue a written certificate signed by him or her setting out such facts as he or she considers relevant with respect to acts or things  Chapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "683df0664c8a229d59744b33d29e664a71869fe9bdd501ec19b050776e52596b" ;
