concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-130-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "130(2) Evidentiary certificates relating to actions by criminal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-130-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A document purporting to be a certificate issued under this section by a certifying officer of a criminal law-enforcement agency and to be signed by him or her:  (a) is to be received in evidence in an exempt proceeding without further proof; and  (b) in an exempt proceeding, is prima facie evidence of the matters stated in the document." ;
