doc:sec-132-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "132(2) Obstruction" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if the person obstructing or hindering has a reasonable excuse. Note: A defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in subsection (2) (see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code).  Chapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications" ;
    cof:pageNumber "333"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-134 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "134 Dealing in preservation notice information or stored"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-134 ;
    values:originalText "communications warrant information  A person may, for the purposes of Part 3-1A, 3-2, 3-3, 3-5 or 3-6 or Chapter 4A:  (a) communicate preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information to another person; or  (b) make use of preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information; or  (c) make a record of preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information; or  (d) give preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information in evidence in a proceeding." ;
    skos:definition "communications warrant information  A person may, for the purposes of Part 3-1A, 3-2, 3-3, 3-5 or 3-6 or Chapter 4A:  (a) communicate preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information to another person; or  (b) make use of preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information; or  (c) make a record of preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information; or  (d) give preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information in evidence in a proceeding."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "40e3372621b0bdf9dedf1f783acaf4fce1d7c0da89f9d1ada23052f81e8daccb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "335"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Communicate preservation notice information or stored communications warrant information." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
