doc:sec-143-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "143(3) Giving information in evidence in exempt proceeding" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) A person may give stored communications warrant information in evidence in an exempt proceeding.  Preserving and accessing stored communications  Chapter 3 Dealing with accessed information etc.  Part 3-4 Permitted dealings with accessed information  Division 2  Section 144  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
