concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-158a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "158A Functions of the Inspector-General of Intelligence and"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-158a ;
    values:originalText "Security  (1) Under the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986, the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security has functions in relation to preservation notices given by the Organisation.  (2) In particular, the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security has the function of:  (a) inquiring into any matter that relates to compliance by the Organisation with this Act (see subparagraph 8(1)(a)(i) of that Act); and  (b) conducting such inspections of the Organisation as the Inspector-General considers appropriate for the purpose of giving effect to the objects of that Act (see section 9A of that Act).  Preserving and accessing stored communications  Chapter 3 Reports about access to stored communications  Part 3-6 Reports to the Minister  Division 1  Section 159  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Security  (1) Under the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986, the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security has functions in relation to preservation notices given by the Organisation.  (2) In particular, the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security has the function of:  (a) inquiring into any matter that relates to compliance by the Organisation with this Act (see subparagraph 8(1)(a)(i) of that Act); and  (b) conducting such inspections of the Organisation as the Inspector-General considers appropriate for the purpose of giving effect to the objects of that Act (see section 9A of that Act).  Preserving and accessing stored communications  Chapter 3 Reports about access to stored communications  Part 3-6 Reports to the Minister  Division 1  Section 159  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8f6fb4eb7f42c0e245e29e63f5b82cc3ba19852681d1ed9aed291f59cf75ec0e" ;
    cof:pageNumber "354"^^xsd:integer ;
