concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-30-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30 June, give to the Minister a written report that sets out such"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-30-2 ;
    values:originalText "information as:  (a) Division 2 (other than section 163A) requires to be set out in the Minister’s report under that Division relating to the year ending on that 30 June; and  (b) can be derived from the agency’s records.  (2) Section 34C of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 does not apply in relation to a report under this section." ;
    skos:definition "information as:  (a) Division 2 (other than section 163A) requires to be set out in the Minister’s report under that Division relating to the year ending on that 30 June; and  (b) can be derived from the agency’s records.  (2) Section 34C of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901 does not apply in relation to a report under this section."@en ;
