concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-161a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "161A Report to contain information about preservation notices"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-161a ;
    values:originalText "Domestic preservation notices  (1) The report must set out, for each criminal law-enforcement agency:  (a) the relevant statistics about domestic preservation notices that were given by the agency during that year; and  (b) the relevant statistics about revocation notices given by the agency under section 107L during that year. Foreign preservation notices  (2) If the criminal law-enforcement agency is the Australian Federal Police, the report must also set out:  (a) the relevant statistics about foreign preservation notices that were given by the agency during that year; and  (b) the relevant statistics about revocation notices given by the agency under section 107R during that year." ;
    skos:definition "Domestic preservation notices  (1) The report must set out, for each criminal law-enforcement agency:  (a) the relevant statistics about domestic preservation notices that were given by the agency during that year; and  (b) the relevant statistics about revocation notices given by the agency under section 107L during that year. Foreign preservation notices  (2) If the criminal law-enforcement agency is the Australian Federal Police, the report must also set out:  (a) the relevant statistics about foreign preservation notices that were given by the agency during that year; and  (b) the relevant statistics about revocation notices given by the agency under section 107R during that year."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "150987780245512eb080caa1e7fc04c5a96bbad861c90c7538d7b90830b5336a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "356"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-161a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-161a-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
