concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-173 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "173 Effect of Divisions 3 to 5"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-173 ;
    values:originalText "Nothing in Divisions 3 to 5 limits the generality of anything else in those Divisions or in Subdivision A of Division 3 of Part 13 of the Telecommunications Act 1997.  Access to telecommunications data  Chapter 4 Permitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1 The Organisation  Division 3  Section 174  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "Nothing in Divisions 3 to 5 limits the generality of anything else in those Divisions or in Subdivision A of Division 3 of Part 13 of the Telecommunications Act 1997.  Access to telecommunications data  Chapter 4 Permitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1 The Organisation  Division 3  Section 174  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "51ea99bced9d848fef95f037ce641554404345c982eed1b4c380c652d5d6c5b2" ;
