doc:sec-174-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "174(2) Voluntary disclosure" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) This section does not apply if the Director-General of Security, the Deputy Director-General of Security or any other ASIO employee or ASIO affiliate requests the holder to disclose the information or document. Note: Sections 175 and 176 deal with the disclosure of information or a document in response to authorisations by the Organisation." ;
    cof:pageNumber "367"^^xsd:integer .

