    values:originalText "(3) The eligible person may, in that authorisation, also authorise the disclosure of specified information or specified documents that came into existence before the time the authorisation comes into force.  Access to telecommunications data  Chapter 4 Permitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1 The Organisation  Division 3  Section 176  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Limits on making the authorisation" ;
    cof:pageNumber "368"^^xsd:integer .

