concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-176a-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "176A(7) Meaning of enforcement agency"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-176a-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) Without limiting subsection (6), a condition may provide that the authority or body is not to exercise a power conferred on an enforcement agency by or under a specified provision in Chapter 4.  Chapter 4  Access to telecommunications data" ;
