doc:sec-177-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "177(3) Voluntary disclosure" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) This section does not apply if a relevant staff member of an enforcement agency requests the holder to disclose the information or document. Note: Sections 178 to 180 deal with the disclosure of information or a document in response to authorisations by an authorised officer of an enforcement agency." ;
