    cof:title "180B(6) Authorisations for access to prospective information or" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(6) The period for which an authorisation under subsection (2) is in force may be extended once only, by an authorised officer of the  Chapter 4  Access to telecommunications data" ;
