concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180r a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "180R Further information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-180r ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Part 4-1 issuing authority may require:  (a) in any case—the chief officer of the agency; or  (b) if the application is made, on the agency’s behalf, by a person other than the chief officer—that other person; to give to the Part 4-1 issuing authority, within the period and in the form specified in the requirement, further information in connection with the application.  (2) If the chief officer or other person breaches the requirement, the" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Part 4-1 issuing authority may require:  (a) in any case—the chief officer of the agency; or  (b) if the application is made, on the agency’s behalf, by a person other than the chief officer—that other person; to give to the Part 4-1 issuing authority, within the period and in the form specified in the requirement, further information in connection with the application.  (2) If the chief officer or other person breaches the requirement, the"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c744ae3eed2d1b124f512a660c714eecb22be1fa359d0b4fe32402ba2e3bdfb3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "391"^^xsd:integer ;
