concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180t a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "180T Issuing a journalist information warrant"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-180t ;
    values:originalText "(1) After considering an application under section 180Q, the Part 4-1 issuing authority must:  (a) issue a journalist information warrant that authorises the making of authorisations under one or more of sections 178, 178A, 179 and 180 in relation to the particular person to which the application relates; or  Chapter 4  Access to telecommunications data" ;
    skos:definition "(1) After considering an application under section 180Q, the Part 4-1 issuing authority must:  (a) issue a journalist information warrant that authorises the making of authorisations under one or more of sections 178, 178A, 179 and 180 in relation to the particular person to which the application relates; or  Chapter 4  Access to telecommunications data"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b07ca77328d24575419862d8237b8821d2bea5582864ac3a1e4940274e050006" ;
    cof:pageNumber "391"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Authority must issue a journalist information warrant upon application." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.391" ;
