concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180u-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "180U(5) Form and content of a journalist information warrant"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-180u-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) Neither of subsections (3) and (4) prevents the issue of a further warrant under this Act in relation to a person, in relation to which a warrant under this Act has, or warrants under this Act have, previously been issued." ;
    skos:definition "(5) Neither of subsections (3) and (4) prevents the issue of a further warrant under this Act in relation to a person, in relation to which a warrant under this Act has, or warrants under this Act have, previously been issued."@en ;
