    values:originalText "(4) A declaration under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument.  Access to telecommunications data  Chapter 4 Permitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1 Uses of telecommunications data connected with provision of access  Division 5  Section 181  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "394"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-181 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "181 Uses of telecommunications data connected with provision of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-181 ;
    values:originalText "access  Section 276, 277 or 278 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 does not prohibit a use by a person of information or a document if:  (a) the use is made for the purposes of, or in connection with, a disclosure of the information or document by the person; and  (b) because of Division 3, 4 or 4A of this Part, the disclosure is not prohibited by that section.  Chapter 4  Access to telecommunications data" ;
    skos:definition "access  Section 276, 277 or 278 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 does not prohibit a use by a person of information or a document if:  (a) the use is made for the purposes of, or in connection with, a disclosure of the information or document by the person; and  (b) because of Division 3, 4 or 4A of this Part, the disclosure is not prohibited by that section.  Chapter 4  Access to telecommunications data"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4b1b7d0c34290712ed29a6670373fa6693b3a5d4e3fbc4cea14bcd37ccd700eb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "395"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Use of telecommunications data for disclosure purposes is permitted." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.395" ;
