doc:sec-182a-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "182A(1) Disclosure/use offences: journalist information warrants" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person discloses or uses information; and  (b) the information is about any of the following:  (i) whether a journalist information warrant (other than such a warrant that relates only to section 178A) has been, or is being, requested or applied for;  (ii) the making of such a warrant;  (iii) the existence or non-existence of such a warrant;  (iv) the revocation of such a warrant. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years." ;
    cof:pageNumber "404"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-182a-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "182A(2) Disclosure/use offences: journalist information warrants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-182a-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person discloses or uses a document; and  (b) the document consists (wholly or partly) of any of the following:  (i) a journalist information warrant (other than such a warrant that relates only to section 178A);  (ii) the revocation of such a warrant. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.  Access to telecommunications data  Chapter 4 Permitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1 Disclosure/use offences  Division 6  Section 182B  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person discloses or uses a document; and  (b) the document consists (wholly or partly) of any of the following:  (i) a journalist information warrant (other than such a warrant that relates only to section 178A);  (ii) the revocation of such a warrant. Penalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.  Access to telecommunications data  Chapter 4 Permitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1 Disclosure/use offences  Division 6  Section 182B  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "78522f43cb6ee32b3dd7f2b382a1e290bab316b655100efd4df74532139cf721" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-182a ;
    cof:pageNumber "404"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Disclosing or using a journalist information warrant without permission is an offence." ;
