t to the Minister and the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security; and  (ii) the Minister must, as soon as practicable after receiving a copy, cause the Parliamentary Joint Committee on Intelligence and Security to be notified of the issuing of the warrant; and  Chapter 4  Access to telecommunications data" ;
