doc:sec-186b-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "186B(5) Inspection of records" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not require the Ombudsman to inspect all of the records of an enforcement agency that are relevant to the matters referred to in paragraphs (1)(a) and (b)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "421"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186B(6) Inspection of records"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-186b-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) While an operation is being conducted under:  (a) a stored communications warrant; or  (b) an authorisation under Division 3, 4 or 4A of Part 4-1;  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A  Section 186C  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  the Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting any records of the agency concerned that are relevant to the obtaining or execution of the warrant or authorisation." ;
    skos:definition "(6) While an operation is being conducted under:  (a) a stored communications warrant; or  (b) an authorisation under Division 3, 4 or 4A of Part 4-1;  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A  Section 186C  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  the Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting any records of the agency concerned that are relevant to the obtaining or execution of the warrant or authorisation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7859b4b0aaf53d8e77c47051fe728abf580fee6d86b38c609a5585a95ad6b85d" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b ;
    cof:pageNumber "421"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting records relevant to the obtaining or execution of a warrant or authorisation." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.421" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b-ss-6-norm .
