concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186f-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186F(4) Exchange of information between Ombudsman or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-186f-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If an IGIS official has obtained, under the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986, information relating to an authority of a State or Territory about the performance of functions of an intelligence agency (within the meaning of that Act) and its officers relating to:  (a) Chapter 3 or 4 of this Act; or  (b) Part 15 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 in relation to the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred by that Part of that Act in connection with a stored  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A  Section 186G  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  communications warrant or an authorisation under" ;
    skos:definition "(4) If an IGIS official has obtained, under the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986, information relating to an authority of a State or Territory about the performance of functions of an intelligence agency (within the meaning of that Act) and its officers relating to:  (a) Chapter 3 or 4 of this Act; or  (b) Part 15 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 in relation to the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred by that Part of that Act in connection with a stored  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A  Section 186G  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  communications warrant or an authorisation under"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fd292af40390325ce1cb48050ba92addf4148b687f5ee7cbab8a61104288a076" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186f ;
    cof:pageNumber "426"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Must provide information about performance of functions of an intelligence agency" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
