concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186g a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "186G Delegation by Ombudsman"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-186g ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Ombudsman may delegate:  (a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or  (b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the Ombudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an employee responsible to that person;  Chapter 4A  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Section 186H  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Chapter other than a power to report to the Minister.  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Ombudsman may delegate:  (a) to an APS employee responsible to the Ombudsman; or  (b) to a person having similar oversight functions to the Ombudsman under the law of a State or Territory or to an employee responsible to that person;  Chapter 4A  Oversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Section 186H  Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  all or any of the Ombudsman’s powers under this Chapter other than a power to report to the Minister.  (2) A delegate must, upon request by a person affected by the exercise of any power delegated to the delegate, produce the instrument of delegation, or a copy of the instrument, for inspection by the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7ca9b836da7e7e31b1ed531f6acef34bf0a73b3473c326226b907993a6756933" ;
    cof:pageNumber "427"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186g-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186g-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.427" .
