doc:sec-186j-ss-7 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "186J(7) Reports" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) A report under this section must not include information which, if made public, could reasonably be expected to:  (a) endanger a person’s safety; or  (b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or  (c) compromise any enforcement agency’s operational activities or methodologies." ;
